              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "il parlamento — \"the parliament\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Il parlamento discute la nuova legge. Parliament is debating the new law."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Stress: parlaménto. Its members are elected by the citizens."
            }
          ]
        },
