              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "il ministro — \"the minister\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Il ministro della salute parla in televisione stasera. The health minister is speaking on television tonight."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Il primo ministro — the prime minister. A woman is also la ministra."
            }
          ]
