          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ministro is a learned borrowing from Latin minister \"servant, attendant\" (Lewis & Short), built on minus \"less\": first the one who serves, then the one who serves the state."
            }
          ]
        },
